{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Players_Describe_v8.png?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Groove to Unique Charts</strong></i></u><i>   </i> <br><i>Draw magic powers from <strong>juicy songs</strong> to cast <strong>satisfying combinations</strong> in VR.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-GIF-1-Groove-60ditherv3-ezgif.com-optimize__2___Zoomed_.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u><i>Learn New Spells</i></u></strong> <br><i>Master the strength of <strong>multiple elements</strong>\u00a0and <strong>level up</strong> to defeat your opponents.</i>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-Gif-2-Learn-v1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>Protect Yourself</u></i></strong><br><i>Be prepared to <strong>deflect</strong> and <strong>dodge</strong> as the dark forces strike back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-Gif-3-Protect-v1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>Pull Off Trickshots</u></i></strong>    <br><i>Channel\u00a0<strong>mana</strong> and <strong>spin</strong> your way into the wizard leaderboards.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-Gif-4-Trickshot-v1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Execute Epic Combos</strong></i></u>     <br><i>Chain <strong>devastating spell sequences</strong> for maximum blast and sick highlights.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-Gif-5-Execute-v1-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>Awaken the Wizard in You</u></i></strong><br><i>Feel the joy of <strong>magic wands</strong> in your hands and see you here in Melodica!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-Gif-6-Awaken-v6every4thframelossy100-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>EXTRA FEATURES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer dynamic challenges with fun gameplay twists &amp; earn tons of rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your Wizard Clan of Music: Hip-Hop, Electro, Latin, Pop or Rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Represent your Clan and compete in the epic Grand Wizard Tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play well, or else, the opponent's Clan remix will play over your remix</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover broken magic builds and outscore rivals with cheeky tactics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>QUICK LORE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teleport into <strong>Melodica</strong>, a magical music dimension. In its center, the Resonance Amplifier channels songs into our real world, influencing music trends and sparking urban legends of mysterious wizard duels.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join one of the <strong>Wizard Clans of Music\u00a0</strong>\u2014 <strong>Hip Hop, Electro, Latin, Pop, or Rock</strong> \u2014 as they duel and compete in the Grand Wizard Tournament for dominance over the global sound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lurking in the shadows, the <strong>evil discords</strong> plot to destroy most of music and throw both the real world and Melodica into chaos. Ready to cast some juicy magic and save the sound in <strong>Spell Beat</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>*</strong>Coming to SteamVR and Meta Quest*</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640160?t=1748797245","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/3eb6bfa7120f99cb6bfd17577dfbcf5c3d71edec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748797245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/bb3bdba12179824b24c485d901a463c827b0ebc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748797245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/bb3bdba12179824b24c485d901a463c827b0ebc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748797245","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Players_Describe_v8.png?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Groove to Unique Charts</strong></i></u><i>   </i> <br><i>Draw magic powers from <strong>juicy songs</strong> to cast <strong>satisfying combinations</strong> in VR.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-GIF-1-Groove-60ditherv3-ezgif.com-optimize__2___Zoomed_.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"