astating spell sequences</strong> for maximum blast and sick highlights.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-Gif-5-Execute-v1-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>Awaken the Wizard in You</u></i></strong><br><i>Feel the joy of <strong>magic wands</strong> in your hands and see you here in Melodica!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/Final-Gif-6-Awaken-v6every4thframelossy100-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748797245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>EXTRA FEATURES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer dynamic challenges with fun gameplay twists &amp; earn tons of rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your Wizard Clan of Music: Hip-Hop, Electro, Latin, Pop or Rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Represent your Clan and compete in the epic Grand Wizard Tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play well, or else, the opponent's Clan remix will play over your remix</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover broken magic builds and outscore rivals with cheeky tactics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>QUICK LORE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teleport into <strong>Melodica</strong>, a magical music dimension. In its center, the Resonance Amplifier channels songs into our real world, influencing music trends and sparking urban legends of mysterious wizard duels.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join one of the <strong>Wizard Clans of Music\u00a0</strong>\u2014 <strong>Hip Hop, Electro, Latin, Pop, or Rock</strong> \u2014 as they duel and compete in the Grand Wizard Tournament for dominance over the global sound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lurking in the shadows, the <strong>evil discords</strong> plot to destroy most of music and throw both the real world and Melodica into chaos. Ready to cast some juicy magic and save the sound in <strong>Spell Beat</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>*</strong>Coming to SteamVR and Meta Quest*</i></p>","developers":["Melodica Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/a117a33e7df69a29056e24d972e7b30b23af0574/header.jpg?t=1748797245","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Spell Beat \u00ae \u2013 All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Spell Beat","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 Skylake or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 or eq